{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"他这会儿喜欢得格外尽兴，连想再靠近一点也让他感到满足。先前的亲近曾真切地安顿他，所以此刻连渴望本身也有了甜味。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他开始能从渴望本身感到满足。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 8,\n      \"why\": \"听感明确支持尽兴的欢喜，而前文亲近带来的真实安稳，也能解释为何渴望本身开始成为快乐。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选2\",\n        \"候选3\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"他这会儿欢喜得格外敞开，仿佛连柔软的一面也能带进亲近里。因为他一直盼着被真正理解，眼前的相处让这份愿望又近了一步。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他开始觉得，亲近也许能容下自己柔软的一面。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 7,\n      \"why\": \"长期少有着落的被理解之愿，能解释这种敞开的欢喜；不过，把它具体理解为他愿意展露柔软的一面，仍有一定推断成分。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选11\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "ad8c0ab9-5f12-4fef-889c-a1c54d58d695", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T021705125713Z", "elapsed_seconds": 127.078, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T02:19:12.221861+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d6b624c8fbc26b0e95794c9b2aa046ce1dc275c09741beb634915f3ac3341cd7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec0663976